"Pylons": {
  "index": "-1",
  "category": "artifice",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Pylons"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Pylons are standing stones carved with runes that "
        },
        {
          "text": "project an effect within a configurable radius",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".  They "
        },
        {
          "text": "constantly consume Eldrin Power",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " of varying affinities and amounts to do so, and can be "
        },
        {
          "text": "toggled off by providing a redstone signal",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nPylons require adequate and sufficient power supply for a couple of seconds in order to charge up and begin applying their effect.\n\nA pylon's radius can be configured in one of two ways.  By default, they use a "
        },
        {
          "text": "radius",
          "underlined": true
        },
        {
          "text": " of 32 blocks.  This can be increased or decreased, and will always be centred on the pylon itself.  The other option is to provide 2 "
        },
        {
          "text": "Runes of Marking",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "whose bounding box must overlap the pylon's bottom block",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nPylons consume more or less "
        },
        {
          "text": "Eldrin Power",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " the larger or smaller their radius is, respectively.  The minimum radius is 1, and the maximum is 128.\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Each pylon's GUI will show you what it needs.  It is well explained with tooltips.",
          "italic": true,
          "color": "dark_gray"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "crafting",
      "location": "mna:inert_pylon"
    }
  ]
}